  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products: ETNA is a women-owned, family apparel brand offering refined business and casual wear. We create versatile, distinctive pieces using premium fabrics, designed for modern, independent women who love quality and express their charisma through refined clothing with unique and classic design.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• What makes us different:  We are a family women-owned business that understands the need of modern women in wardrobe essentials. We combine precise tailoring with comfort, using high-quality fabrics. Our pieces are designed to hold structure while remaining wearable all day, produced in certified factories we personally verify.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn: Affiliates earn a commission on every sale generated through their unique link or promo code. We offer competitive rates and opportunities for long-term collaboration. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us: </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Through styling content, outfit inspiration, and product features across social media, blogs, or newsletters. Highlight versatility, quality, and real-life wearability.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p></div></div>",
